          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.15+LEV.23.16+LEV.23.17+LEV.23.18+LEV.23.19+LEV.23.20+LEV.23.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 23:15-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 16:9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ka ceng’ mi Pentekote tundo, kagi ceke gibedo karacelo i ka acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E aruca ruca nica ba gin moko ai i polo pami wavuvu m’ukoto, man epong’o ot ceke ka ma gibedo i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E leb m’ukaru pami lebmac, uwok i wang’gi; man ebedo i wigi kubang’gi nzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kagi ceke Tipo Maleng’ uromogi, man gimaku weco ku dhok ma nge nge, calu wec ma Tipo mio igi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u Juyahudi gibedo Yerusalem, gi dhanu ma lworo Mungu, ma giai kud i thek ceke ma the polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka ba gin maeni winjre, udul dhanu gicoko dhoggi karacelo, e lembene loyogi, kum dhanu kubang’gi nzu giwinjo gibeweco ku dhu thugi ma dhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kagi ceke gipoi igi de wang’ lii, giwacu kumae, Nen, joni ceke ma giweco gi Jugalilaya ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawinjo ku dhu thuwa ma junyolo kowa kubang’wa ceke ngi nenedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juparthi ku Jumedi man Juelemiti, ku ju m’ubedo i Mesopotamia, i Yahudi man Kapadokia, i Ponto man Asia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i Frugia man Pamfulia, i Misiri man ng’et Libua ma yo ba Kurene, ku jubedo m’uai i Rumi, Juyahudi ku ju ma juloko wang’gi bende, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jukrete man ju Arabi, wawinjo gibeweco ku dhu thuwa kwa pi tic ma dwong’ pa Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kagi ceke igi wang’ lii, e igi pido kwe, giwacu gigi kumae, Thelembe maeni ang’o? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento jumange giyero ku cac kumae, Pigulok ma nyasa merogi en.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Petro, m’ucungo giku juwagi apar wi acel, eting’o dwande malu, eyero igi kumae, Wu dhanu mi Yahudi, ku kewu ceke ma wubedo i Yerusalem de, dong’ wung’ei lembe nini, man wucik ithwu kum lem para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum joni gimer amera ngo, calu ma wuwacu nyo; kum ceng’ udoko saa adek kende; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento maeni en e lembe m’uyere ni kum jabila ma Yoel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umego, acopo yero iwu dwe dwe pi Daudi ma kwaru, nia etho man juyike, man ke odliel pare ni i kindwa cil i ceng’ maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.132.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 132:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum en e jabila, m’eng’eyo de nia Mungu ng’olo ire ku kwong’, nia kum kodhi mi kume ebiketho ng’atu acel wi komker pare: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en m’elar eneno maeni eyero pi cer ma Kristu bicer ko, nia juweke ni Hadeya ngo, kadi ring’kume de neno top ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu maeni Mungu ketho ecer, ma kawa ceke de wa jumulembene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno en ma judo de malu ba cing’ Mungu ma yor acwic, m’ejolo lembang’ola ma Wego ng’olo pi Tipo Maleng’, ekonjo gin maeni, ma wuneno wuwinjo de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 110:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Daudi idho i polo ngo: ento ewacu en kumae,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man lworo makugi kubang’gi ceke: e musana ku giranyutha dupa timbre ni kum jukwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.4.32+ACT.4.33+ACT.4.34+ACT.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 4:32-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ju m’uyio ceke gibedo karacelo, piny migi ceke de bedo ariba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man giloko jupiny migi ku jamni migi de, gipoko de ku ba dhanu ceke, calku canpiny ma ni kum dhanu kubang’gi kubang’gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ku ba rupiny ku ba rupiny, ma gibedo asu ku cwinygi m’uripo acel i hekalu, ku kwen m’ang’weka de i udigi, gijolo cemo migi ku mutoro kwa kud adunde m’ucungo acel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma gipaku ko Mungu, ma gibedo ku bero de ku ba dhanu ceke. E Rwoth ueikumedo igi ju m’uboth ku ba rupiny ku ba rupiny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.47"
            ]
          }
